   "text": "Qdrant cluster   ·   4 × r6i.2xlarge (64 GB)   ·   EKS StatefulSet\nshard_key = ticker  ·  12 shards  ·  replication factor 2\ntenant HNSW: ticker is_tenant=true · payload_m 16 · global m 0\nint8 scalar quantization in RAM · fp16 vectors on disk · rescore top-N\nnamed vectors:  dense[1024] (Matryoshka)  +  sparse bm25 (idf modifier)",
